    <description><![CDATA[<p>Each Sunday, Pitchfork takes an in-depth look at a significant album from the past, and any record not in our archives is eligible. Today, we revisit the iconoclastic trio’s embattled and cathartic 2006 album: a swan song for the artists’ imperial phase and for their bitterly fractured country.</p>
