    <description><![CDATA[<p>With new songs that rank among his very best, the Geese frontman’s solo live album is an exquisite rendering of a had-to-be-there night and a work of real-time mythmaking.</p>
<img src="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6a8374d55eeaf65ef2de9c77/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Live%20at%20Carnegie%20Hall_1500X.jpg" alt="Live at Carnegie Hall cover"/>
